       <p class="eyebrow">About &middot; GameDrawer &middot; Vol. I</p>
       <h1>A calm drawer of classic games.</h1>
-      <p class="lede">GameDrawer is a local-first iPhone home for ten classic logic, word, and arcade games. It exists because most of the modern versions of these games have been hollowed out - and the originals deserved better than that.</p>
+      <p class="lede">GameDrawer is a local-first iPhone home for eleven classic logic, word, and arcade games. It exists because most of the modern versions of these games have been hollowed out - and the originals deserved better than that.</p>
 
       <p>Open Solitaire, Sudoku, Minesweeper, or a Merge clone on the App Store today and you'll usually meet the same wall: a banner ad, a forced video ad after every level, fake coins to spend, energy meters that lock you out, paywalls in front of basic features, and a tutorial that won't let you skip. GameDrawer inverts every one of those decisions. The first launch drops you straight into a game. Your stats live on your device. There is no account to make, no email to verify, no upsell to dismiss.</p>
 
@@ -142,7 +142,10 @@
 
       <p>GameDrawer was built to remove every one of those failures. Tap to play. No popups. No paywalls. No tracking. No required network connection. A clean cabinet of games that opens fast, runs offline, and lets the actual game be the thing you remember.</p>
 
-      <h2>The ten games</h2>
+      <h2>The eleven games</h2>
+
+      <h3>Math Crossword</h3>
+      <p>Fill missing numbers so every crossing equation works. Choose Easy, Medium or Hard, use the number bank, undo a move, and resume saved progress. Hints point to a deduction before you choose to reveal and apply its numbers. Assisted wins count without setting records.</p>
 
       <h3>Minesweeper</h3>
       <p>The full classic, properly tuned. Three difficulties - Easy 9&times;9/10 mines, Medium 16&times;16/40, Hard 16&times;30/99. <strong>First-tap safety</strong> is guaranteed: your first reveal will never land on a mine. Empty cells flood-fill correctly. Tap to reveal, long-press to flag.</p>
